                        "glosses": [
                            "A crafter of phrases; one who pens bombast or rhetoric."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce4a67ed-c5c0-48b2-bf35-57a6d4a52fa9",
                                "sense_id": "c239d658-68f8-30d8-8e42-dfa8cd8ca6d0",
                                "text": "But even as you read this, some sharp political phrasemaker is working on a paragraph that begins “Not in a hundred days, not in a hundred hours, but in a hundred New York minutes ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01273c8e-21e1-4a31-85fa-1212433d86ad",
                                "sense_id": "c239d658-68f8-30d8-8e42-dfa8cd8ca6d0",
                                "text": "As the entrepreneur Peter Thiel — whose politics I loathe, but who’s a good phrasemaker — put it, it was an era in which we wanted flying cars but got 140 characters instead."
                            }
                        ]
